# TableCraft UI: bounded read-only Zoom box.
zoom-title = Zoom
zoom-read-only = Read-only enlargement. Changes use the separate reviewed cell editor.
zoom-query-read-only = Query results are read only.
zoom-copy = Copy complete value
zoom-edit = Edit through review…
zoom-copy-unavailable = The complete value could not be copied.
zoom-continued = Very long lines continue on another visual row. Copy preserves the original line breaks.
zoom-text-size = Text size
zoom-ok = OK
zoom-cancel = Cancel
zoom-limit = Zoom supports displayed values up to 8 MiB.
zoom-unavailable = The enlarged value could not be prepared.
